      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Code Simplicity (`DfuPollIdle`):**\n\n1. With `DfuStatusResponse` storing `DfuStatus` and `DfuState` and `kDfuManifestWaitReset` handled by `default:` (returning `RtsError::kProtocolError`), the loop body avoids manual enum casts and matches the header contract (`dfuIDLE` or `dfuDNLOAD-IDLE`).\n2. In the sleep calculation (lines 359–364), `std::max(status-\u003epoll_timeout, kDfuMinPollDelay)` replaces the ternary, and `kUsbDfuTimeout - slept` already has common type `std::chrono::milliseconds` without `std::chrono::duration_cast`:\n\n```cpp\nstd::expected\u003cDfuState, RtsError\u003e RtsUsbDevice::DfuPollIdle(int interface) {\n  using enum DfuState;\n\n  // Bound the whole wait: the manifest phase (flash programming and image\n  // verification) can take tens of seconds.\n  std::chrono::milliseconds slept{0};\n\n  while (slept \u003c kUsbDfuTimeout) {\n    auto status \u003d DfuGetStatus(interface);\n    if (!status) {\n      return std::unexpected(status.error());\n    }\n\n    if (status-\u003estatus !\u003d DfuStatus::kOk || status-\u003estate \u003d\u003d kDfuError) {\n      std::println(stderr, \"DFU error: bStatus\u003d{}, bState\u003d{}\",\n                   std::to_underlying(status-\u003estatus),\n                   std::to_underlying(status-\u003estate));\n      return std::unexpected(RtsError::kDeviceRejected);\n    }\n\n    switch (status-\u003estate) {\n      case kDfuIdle:\n      case kDfuDnloadIdle:\n        // Terminal success states.\n        return status-\u003estate;\n\n      case kDfuDnloadSync:\n      case kDfuDnloadBusy:\n      case kDfuManifestSync:\n      case kDfuManifest:\n        // Transient / busy states: wait for the suggested poll interval.\n        break;\n\n      default:\n        std::println(stderr, \"Unexpected DFU state: bState\u003d{}\",\n                     std::to_underlying(status-\u003estate));\n        return std::unexpected(RtsError::kProtocolError);\n    }\n\n    // Never sleep past the overall timeout.\n    const auto delay \u003d std::min(\n        std::max(status-\u003epoll_timeout, kDfuMinPollDelay),\n        kUsbDfuTimeout - slept);\n\n    sleep_(delay);\n    slept +\u003d delay;\n  }\n\n  std::println(stderr, \"Timed out waiting for DFU idle state.\");\n  return std::unexpected(RtsError::kTimeout);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/b2c5d976-5204-4274-85f0-ebbdd5e79b54)",
